<title>USA: TABLE - Berlitz International Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Berlitz International Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.20		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net			  1,900		    1,000</p>
<p> Revs			95,000		   91,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,543		    9,434</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.12</p>
<p> Net			  2,100		    1,200</p>
<p> Revs		     183,400		  180,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,475		    9,733</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Strong dollar hurt Q2 1997 revenues by $5.7 million and six-months revenues by $10.8 million compared to year-ago periods.</p>
